This plan executes the exact approved sources; PRD owns product acceptance and SD owns architecture. No implementation, review fulfillment or QA result is claimed here. Every evidence path below is a planned run-local output, not an existing passing report. Reused evidence must match the actual changed candidate and dependencies. Earlier bootstrap evidence remains historical until integrated requalification.

## 1. Task List

| task_id | Task | Owner | Dependencies |
|---|---|---|---|
| T-001 | Capture exact preparation baseline, shared-owner overlap, protected reference hashes and fixed before/after corpus; recheck Brownfield after TP approval | Implementation-preparation Brownfield owner / Codex | TP approval; no code before fulfilled preparation |
| T-002 | Share complete proposed/persisted state and typed continuation/completion across all current readers/writers | Core evaluation owner / Codex | T-001 |
