| T-004 | Extend bounded recording/receipt/evidence associations and v3 journal with owned-path recovery; retain existing receipt authorities | Existing recording/transaction owner / Codex | T-002, T-003 |
| T-005 | Converge presentation/exact approval, non-approval recording and canonical version decision guard under existing locks | Existing presentation/approval/run-step owners / Codex | T-004 |
| T-006 | Integrate and requalify supported revision owners including early UR-at-SD bootstrap, exact history and renewed same-Run flow | Existing revision/history owner / Codex | T-002, T-004 |
| T-007 | Implement recoverable structured OR/full completion and shared current/history/unknown evidence projection | Existing closeout/evidence/evaluator owner / Codex | T-004, T-006 |
| T-008 | Wire actual CLI/MCP worker delegation, tool capabilities/permissions/budgets, app-only facade and unknown-effect transport behavior | Existing CLI/MCP/package owners / Codex | T-003, T-005, T-006, T-007 |
| T-009 | Implement focused exact-version card/document return and bounded decision-session lifecycle; retain general cockpit/draft checks | Existing control-ui/document/session owners / Codex | T-005, T-007, T-008 |
| T-010 | Qualify generated candidate, actual STDIO/MCP compatibility/security/fault matrix and rendered registered locales | Runtime/transport verification owner / Codex | T-008, T-009 |
| T-011 | Prepare and collect actual human Codex inline/large-view decision, permission/accessibility/teardown sequence on exact candidate | Native evidence owner / Codex; Arndt Gold performs human actions | T-010; explicitly loaded exact candidate and observable host capability |
| T-012 | Complete integrated benefit comparison, TP/Clean Implementation/Code Reviews and QA evidence with all gaps explicit | Existing review/qa-gate owners / Codex | T-010, T-011; actual CD+Tests and required review ordering |

The stages are dependent inside one Run, not independent fixes or separate approval chains. T-001 is performed through existing Brownfield preparation after TP approval. T-002–T-009 implement owned changes only after that preparation permits CD+Tests. A stage is complete only when its affected scenarios pass with actual outputs; T-012 cannot declare whole-run success while an earlier consumer remains contradictory. No automatic Git staging/commit, installation, host restart or source revision is implied by these tasks.

